## Build Runner Command
```bash
flutter pub run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
```

---

## Implementation Order
When building this project, always follow this order:
1. `theme.dart` + `app.dart` + `router.dart`
2. `core/` utilities and constants
3. Data layer: Hive model → datasource → repository impl
4. Domain layer: entity → abstract repository → use cases
5. Presentation layer: providers → pages → widgets
6. Bottom navigation shell
7. Screens: Home → Add Transaction → History → Report


